              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Percentage of recorded trips with a valid route-specific distance benchmark.\n\nCalculated as Mileage Assessed Trips divided by Total Trips.\n\nA valid benchmark requires at least 20 comparable trips from at least two other drivers traveling between the same pair of locations, regardless of vehicle.\n\nGeneric destinations such as \"Shop\" and \"Office\" are excluded from mileage assessment.\n\nMissing benchmarks indicate insufficient reference data, not necessarily correct or incorrect mileage.\n'"
